<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37544" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-dūco</span></b> , xi, ctum, 3,
			v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to draw</i>, <i>make</i>, or <i>put before</i> or <i>in front</i>
			(not in Cic.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fossam et maceriam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 7, 69</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fossas transversas viis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. B.
					C. 1, 27</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tib. 4, 1, 83</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fossas muris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					10, 411</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 2, 8, 6</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">murum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 7, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lineas itineri,</span>”
				<i>to mark out the way by drawn lines</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 4, 21, § 75</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
